{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏論疏云：一持雙山、二持軸山、三檐木山、四善見山、五馬耳山、六象鼻山、七魚嘴山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云猫牛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云勝猫牛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云無熱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云勝身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云有勝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云有勝邊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云具諂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云儀上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云青蓮華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云攝腦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云絲種種亦云紋身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云持地子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上四天四十中劫為一大劫，以下諸天八十中劫為一大劫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云須臾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或名別劫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云眾所許"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即懿師摩王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音丘慈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云和合亦云凝滑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云皰結"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云肉團"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云堅實"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云肢體筋力\n等生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云正斷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "A"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "B"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "C"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "D"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "E"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "F"}
